window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A pathfinder is invaluable. A captured pathfinder is unstoppable.</b><br> <br> In a world where survival is measured not by fortune but by utility, Timothy Ross understands the game better than anyone. His tenure within Mosaic isn’t built on morality—it’s forged through calculation, influence, and the unwavering ability to stay <i>useful</i>.<br> <br> Shai would be the perfect conquest—an unbonded pathfinder, ready to be molded into whatever Ross desires. But as power shifts and alliances tighten, the battle for control is never truly won. And as the hunt for Shai moves forward, one question remains: who will hold the reins when the dust finally settles?<br> <br> (An m/m novella in the <i>Pathfinder</i> universe)</p>"; 
